      "writtenOn": "2026-01-09T13:07:40Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I would be slightly in favour of removing it completely as quickly as possible, since we otherwise might end up in a hard to maintain mix for a long time.\n\nAdding or updating is still straightforward if not even more so. Or what are your concerns with migrating completely?",
